<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 9.490 billion pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 9.490 billion pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 9.490 billion pesos from the secondary market on Monday through seven auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>  750 million  11 days</p>
<p>  750 million  10 days</p>
<p>    1.500 bln   9 days</p>
<p>    2.800 bln   8 days</p>
<p>    2.200 bln   7 days</p>
<p>    1.200 bln   3 days</p>
<p>	290 million   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
